  "body_html": "<p>Experience ultimate comfort with this 5-piece comforter set from Jeminise, designed to bring a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space. Filled with premium, finely brushed microfibers, this set offers exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability for a peaceful night's sleep.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete 5-Piece Set:</strong> Includes one comforter (68\" x 90\"), one flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), one fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish patterns and exquisite stitching that enhances durability and prevents filling from shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit Fitted Sheet:</strong> Deep-pocket fitted sheet with an elastic band on all four sides accommodates mattresses up to 14 inches thick for a secure fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low for hassle-free maintenance and long-lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All Season Comfort:</strong> Designed to provide comfort throughout all seasons, including Fall, Summer, and Winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Horror Cartoon Theme:</strong> Adds a fun and spooky touch to your bedroom decor with a Halloween-inspired horror cartoon theme.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
